    "Scan of the 1966 edition of the Pomeroyton, Kentucky, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1976; field checked in 1951; photo inspected in 1983; photo revised in 1978; last revised in 1978; printed in 1991.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 23 x 27.4 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
